# Odoo Proxy — Login Step 1
# Fetches the login page, extracts session_id (step 1) and csrf_token.
# After running, copy the Set-Cookie value into the Cookie header of step 2
# and the csrf_token from the HTML into the POST body of step 2.

GET my.odoo.url/web/login HTTP/1.1
Host: my.odoo.url

### Response:
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
# Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 20:05:25 GMT
# Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
# Transfer-Encoding: chunked
# Connection: close
# Cache-Control: no-cache
# X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
# Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
# Set-Cookie: session_id=session_id_from_step_1; Expires=Thu, 22 Jul 2027 20:05:25 GMT; Max-Age=604800; HttpOnly; Path=/
# X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, nosniff
# Server: Odoo.sh
# Content-Encoding: gzip

